<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77121" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάμ-πολυς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλλη</span> (v. infr.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>very great, large</i>, or
				<i>numerous</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάγελως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					320
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆς πλῆθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					677e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στράτευμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					2.4.26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					640d
				</span></i>
			 (but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάμπολλος</span> as fem.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				4.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				89.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Synt.</u>
				36.27
			</span></i>): in pl., <i>very many</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				694
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				373c
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> neut.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάμπολυ</span>, as Adv.,
				<i>very much</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				255d
			</span></i>, etc.; cf. foreg.</div>
